

TOPAZ.ZIP was created with PKZIP version 1.1.  It contains directories and
files so please unzip it with the following command line:

      C>e:unzip -d e:topaz

where C is your local drive and e is your cdrom drive.  The -d parameter
tells unzip to create the directories contained in the zip file.

The following is a listing of the files contained in TOPAZ.ZIP:

  \BROWSER\BROWSE.EXE    - a DBF file browser
  \BROWSER\BROWSE.C       
  \BROWSER\BUDGET.DBF
  \BROWSER\CB.DBF
  \BROWSER\CUSTOMER.DBF
  \BROWSER\SALES.DBF

  \MEMODEMO\MEMODEMO.EXE - sample data entry application
  \MEMODEMO\MEMODEMO.RPT 
  \MEMODEMO\MEMODEMO.DBT
  \MEMODEMO\MEMODEMO.DBF
  \MEMODEMO\MEMODEMO.C
  \MEMODEMO\EDITOR.HLP
  \MEMODEMO\MEMODEM2.RPT

  \PHONE\PHONE.EXE       - a real-world database application
  \PHONE\PHONSCRN.OBJ
  \PHONE\FONEDATA.DBF
  \PHONE\FAXLIST.RPT
  \PHONE\FONEDATA.DBT
  \PHONE\FAXBILL.RPT
  \PHONE\VOICLIST.RPT
  \PHONE\VOICBILL.RPT
  \PHONE\PHONE.LIB
  \PHONE\ALLLIST.RPT
  \PHONE\PHONE.C

  \SAVERS\SAVER2.EXE     - a demo of screen saver
  \SAVERS\SAVER2.C
  \SAVERS\CB.DBF
  \SAVERS\CUSTOMER.DBF

  \TED\TED.EXE           - text editor
  \TED\TED.C
  \TED\EDITOR.HLP

  \VIEW\VF.EXE           - text file viewer
  \VIEW\VIEW.C
  \VIEW\VIEW.H
  \VIEW\VF.C

  \WINDEMO\TZWDEMO.EXE   - sample Windows database application
  \WINDEMO\TZWDEMO.CPP
  \WINDEMO\TZWDEMO.DBF
  \WINDEMO\TZWDEMO.DBT
  \WINDEMO\TZWDEMO.DEF
  \WINDEMO\TZWDEMO.H
